  "title": "Portabella Basil Sub",
  "description": "A savory mixture of portabella mushrooms, spinach, basil, and yellow bell pepper in a piquant sauce is piled high on a hoagie bun and served hot.",
  "authors": [
    "Dave Espionage"
  ],
